    {
      "title": "10. Lead, Kindly Light",
      "author": "John H.Newman",
      "lyrics": "Vakna nunnem, mial na’n hon um\nNang honpi in,\nZan a mial lua; inn apan gamla ing,\nNang honpi in\nKa khe kem in, gamlapi muh ngen keng;\nKei a dingin kal khat, ka suan leng hun.\nTuabang hingeilou, thum leng thum ngeilou;\nHonpiin chi’n,\nKa deih teelin na pai; mah leng tu’n zaw,\nNang honpiin,\nNopsakna ka na ngai, lauhna theilou;\nKisathei hi’ng, kum paisa mangngilh in.\nNa hatna’n Non kem gige, tuin leng\nNonpi ding hi,\nLoutam, linglak, kawl leh kense lak ah,\nZan beima tan; khua hong vak chian,\nAngelte nuih mel mu’n,\nKa mansak zual, ka na deih tawntung hi.",
