      "title": "101. Sowing the Seed of the Kingdom",
      "author": "Fred A. Fillmore",
      "lyrics": "Lalgam chihoih na tuh jeljel na hiam unau,\nJingsang nivak kilawm ah?\nLalgam chihoih na tuh jeljel na hiam unau,\nSunkimlai nisa khauh nuai ah.\nBuhlak hun a hongtung pahta ding,\nBuhlak nasep pat ahipah ding;\nNa buhphal atam diam,\nBuhpang ah na sung diam?\nPawltak chia inn a kaihkhawm dingin.\nLalgam chihoih na tuh jeljel na hiam unau,\nZan khosiang leh dai nuai ah?\nLalgam chihoih na tuh jeljel na hiam unau,\nBuh hoih leh siangthou lakna ding?\nLalgam chihoih na tuh jeljel na hiam unau,\nLei hoihna mun koipeuh ah?\nLalgam chihoih na tuh jeljel na hiam unau,\nNitawp chiangin na at ngei ding?",
