      "lyrics": "Hun kidangta, vaihawmna ni thupi,\nSunchin ka naih semsem;\nKhemna leh lungkham buainate,\nKa dougal tuibang a hong lian.\nAw, khattang hon nusia ken,\nKa kiang ah om jel in;\nZion tang etlawm ka tun ma'n,\nKa Hondampa, hon pi jel in.\nKa ma ah khemna tuipi a hong lian,\nMan ding lau veng Toupa;\nTua chiaului a tumsate zaw,\nTangtawn gam tuangtungnawn-louding.\nNoa damlaia thil omdan bang in,\nLeh Sodom khua bang in;\nMahni nopsakna kia zong in;\nAw, Toupa hon heisanta uh.\nNa laibu siangthou a kigelh bang in,\nNuai simlei a buaita,\nKiitna a hong dai zouta,\nBuaina leh lungkhamna'n a dim.\nSimlei gimhuaina leh lungkhamnain,\nPa' mel hon musak in;\nZion tate i noplenna'ng,\nNi thupi a hong naita hi.",
