      "lyrics": "Ka lenna gamdai tuangnung sia'n,\nVan Jerusalem nunnuam ah;\nBangchik leh tuang k'ong tung sam diam?\nNa tangtawn pialgal gam ah.\nAw, ka ngai gibang khenlouhna gamnuam ah,\nHinna tui a luang;\nHotdamtaten a dawn ua,\nTangtawn hinna tang uh.\nBelamnou lenna mun thupi,\nNgaiin sunchin galin don veng;\nAw Laukha Siangthou, hong leng in,\nNa gam ah tuang hontun in.\nKongkhak ging kilawm a hong ua,\nA ging lawmnou in lung honlen;\nMisiangthoute tuallenna ah,\nAw, kei zong len ka nuam hi.\nAw, tua mun ah ka Mang deihhuai,\nA mel sunni vanglai bang in;\nA vaknate tang kimvel e,\nTangtawn a damna ding in.",
