      "lyrics": "I kimuh nawn mateng Pathian in,\nA khotuah siamna’n hon veng hen;\nA belam bittak’n hon huai hen,\nI kimuh nawn ma’n Hon ompih hen.\nI kimuh nawn mateng,\nJesu kiang i kimuh ma’n;\nI kimuh nawn mateng,\nI kimuh nawn ma’n Hon ompih hen.\nI kimuh nawn mateng Pathian in,\nA khanuai bittak’ hon sel hen;\nNiteng Manna honpe lai hen,\nI kimuh nawn ma’n Hon ompih hen.\nI kimuh nawn mateng Pathian in,\nDamsung lauhuai in hon bawm chian;\nA angsung bit ah hon pom hen,\nI kimuh nawn ma’n Hon ompih hen.\nI kimuh nawn mateng Pathian in,\nItna kha na tunga zakin;\nSihna lauhuai hon zoh sak hen,\nI kimuh nawn ma’n Hon ompih hen.",
      "source": "assets/94.html"
    },
    {
      "title": "95. There is Sunshine",
      "author": "E.E. Hewitt",
      "lyrics": "Tuni’n ka kha ah sunni tang,\nVakna thupi ahi;\nLeitung nisanga vakpha zaw,\nJesu ka vakna hi.\nAw sunni tang, sunni tang nuam,\nMuanna leh kipahna hunte liam;\nJesu’n a nuihmel honlah chian,\nKa kha ah sunni tang hi.\nTuni’n ka kha ah zaila ging,\nKa kumpipa phatna;\nJesu’n ngaikhia in zaza hi,\nKa sakkhiak theih louh zong.\nTuni’n ka kha ah nahnoulai,\nToupa hongnai ziakin;\nMuanna khuva ka lung ah ham,\nZahngaihna pak hong lang.\nTuni’n ka kha kipakin om,\nLamet phatna, itna;\nTua vualjawlna kei honpiak toh,\nVanah pahna koihlai.",
      "source": "assets/95.html"
    },
    {
      "title": "96. The Voice of the Savior",
      "author": "Jessie H.Brown",
      "lyrics": "Hondampa aw in “Hong in” chi,\nA sihna sing kros kimu hi;\nTu’n leng kros phung ah mun omlai,\nTuzan in Jesu kiang non juan diam?\nTuzan in Jesu kiang non juan diam?\nTuzan in Jesu kiang non juan diam?\nMouneipa leh Kha in hon chial,\nTuzan in Jesu kiang non juan diam?\nI pa aw in hon chial chial hi,\nZahngaihna sangtawp lamdang in;\nA itna luang honsapna ah,\nTuzan in Jesu kiang non juan diam?\nIt leh ngaihte’n hon na ngetsak,\nNa lungin adik uh na thei;\nUt ve, hunte pai hulhul veh!\nTuzan in Jesu kiang non juan diam?\nI lawm it paisate aw in,\nVak gam a pan hong gingkhia in;\nAw nem in gen tuantuan uhi,\nTuzan in Jesu kiang non juan diam?\nAw, kuahiam thudik jui nuam ding?\nMiteng hiai aw in chial vek hi;\nKuan dawng ding, unau na dawng diam?\nTuzan in Jesu kiang non juan diam?",
      "source": "assets/96.html"
    },
    {
      "title": "97. Blest Be the Tie",
      "author": "John Fawcett",
      "lyrics": "Kristian itna lungsim,\nA i kigakkhawm nuam;\nLungkituakte kipawlkhawmna,\nVanlam omdan ahi.\nI Pa tutphah ma ah,\nI thumnate pia hang;\nI lauh, i tup, i lamet khat,\nNopsak, awlmoh kibang.\nDahna kithuakpih in,\nPuakgik i kidawn chiat;\nA kallak chiangin lainatna,\nKhitui i kiluan chiat.\nGibang i kikhen chian,\nLungsim sung hon dahsak;\nHizong lungsim kizom gige’n\nKimuh nawn lamen hang.\nHiai kinepna thupi’n,\nLampi ah hon halhsak;\nLamen chiata i hin sungin,\nNi thupi ngaklah hang.\nLungkham, sepgim, natna,\nKhelhna pan i suakta;\nItna bukim, kipawlkhawmna,\nTangtawn in omta hen.",
      "source": "assets/97.html"
    },
    {
      "title": "98. A Charge To Keep I Have",
      "author": "Charles Wesley",
      "lyrics": "Thukhah zuih ding ka nei,\nPahtawi ding Pathian khat;\nA si ngeilou kha hotdam ding,\nVan tungsak ngei dingin.\nToupa na sem jel ding,\nHon sapna tangtun ding;\nKa Heutupa deihlam sem di’n,\nKa hatna teng pia ning.\nKiging leh thum dingin,\nNangmah muang hon panpi’n;\nKa muanna kon zuausan aleh,\nTangtawn a si ding hi’ng.",
      "source": "assets/98.html"
    },
    {
      "title": "99. Will Your Anchor Hold?",
      "author": "Priscilla J.Owens",
      "lyrics": "Damsung huihpi ah na long a kip diam,\nMeipi kai in buaina kha honzak chian?\nTui kihawt hat a, long khau kikan chian,\nNa sikkip a tolh diam, akip ding hiam?\nI kha bitna ding sikkip i nei,\nTui kihawt lauhuai a kip, muanhuai;\nLingvuallou Suangpi a khihkip hi,\nHondampa itna a thukpi a phum.\nBittak a kaih hi, huihpi nangzou ding,\nHondampa khut a hoihtak khihkip hi;\nLongkhau di’n Amah’ lungsim kei hon guan,\nPathian hatna’n huihpi hat douzou ni.\nSihna tuikhang lian a leng muanhuai hi,\nA tuivot in hat tawpna khingsak zong;\nTuikhang lian ah leng tan ngeingeilou ding,\nLametna Amah a nga in om le’ng.\nHuai zan kikhopna mun mit a mu in,\nLong khawlna ding sana khopi i juan;\nVan luipiau ah i kinga pahta ding,\nHuihpi lauhuai tuangnung i siahsan ding.\nLauhuaina hawkguam kal ah zong muanhuai,\nTui kihawt in suangphum guk om hon hilh;\nTui kihawt mau in huih hat hong nung zong,\nTui kihawt in i long hon tumlou ding.",
      "source": "assets/99.html"
    }
  ],
